WEBVTT

00:02.560 --> 00:07.000
Prince of Ning, the Clan Head has a message for you. Chancellor Chen's intent is:

00:16.280 --> 00:23.000
If a deed is not done, so be it; but if it is to be done, it must be executed without mercy!

00:22.680 --> 00:24.000
His meaning is...

00:28.600 --> 00:30.200
Allow me to consider this further.

00:30.320 --> 00:32.500
Your Highness, delay will invite catastrophe!

00:32.160 --> 00:33.500
Insolence!

00:34.400 --> 00:38.000
Since when was it Chancellor Chen's place to dictate commands to me?!

00:37.080 --> 00:40.000
This servant would never dare...
